          "title": "Booking Availability Interval Minutes"
        },
        "price": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maximum": 99999999.99,
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "description": "Price for the booking type. Set to 0 for free booking types. How many decimal places are accepted depends on the currency: a currency with no sub-unit (JPY, KRW, CLP, VND and the other zero-decimal currencies) takes whole amounts only, every other currency takes at most 2. Trailing zeros are notation rather than precision, so 2200.00 is a valid JPY price. The currency judged is the one sent in `currency_code`, or your account currency when that is omitted. A price below Stripe's minimum charge for the currency (0.50 USD, for example) is refused on Stripe and TidyCal Payments, and a currency PayPal doesn't list is refused on PayPal. A recurring session or subscription plan price is held to the minimum the recurring charge uses, which is higher in some currencies (50 INR, for example).",
          "title": "Price"
        },
        "payment_platform": {
          "anyOf": [
